<%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle: pageTitle }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main class="fb-container fb-main">
  <div class="fb-content">
    <h1 class="fb-title">Help</h1>
    <p class="fb-muted">Answers to the questions members ask most.</p>

    <dl class="fb-faq">
      <dt>What is FieldBrik?</dt>
      <dd>FieldBrik is an independent online building and gaming platform. You construct places out of simple bricks, publish them, and play or build alongside other members. It is built in the spirit of the early, community-run building communities of 2006 to 2008.</dd>

      <dt>How do I create an account?</dt>
      <dd>Choose a username, an email address and a password on the <a href="/login">sign-in page</a>: a name nobody has taken becomes your account, and a name that is already yours signs you back in. Usernames are unique and are how other members find you. You must be old enough to agree to the Terms of Service.</dd>

      <dt>How do I log in?</dt>
      <dd>Use the username and password you registered with. Your session is kept in a secure, server-side session, so you stay signed in across browser sessions until you log out.</dd>

      <dt>How do I view somebody's profile?</dt>
      <dd>Search for them on the People page and open their profile. A profile shows their avatar, description, join date, badges, statistics and online status.</dd>

      <dt>How do I change my avatar?</dt>
      <dd>Open the Character page to set the colour of your head, torso, arms and legs, and to pick a face. Saved changes apply everywhere your avatar appears.</dd>

      <dt>How do I manage friends?</dt>
      <dd>The Friends page lists your friends and any pending requests. You can accept, reject or remove friends there. Duplicate requests are prevented, so you will not receive the same request twice.</dd>

      <dt>How do I send a message?</dt>
      <dd>Open <a href="/messages">Messages</a> and write to a member by username, or use Send Message on their profile. A message is only shown to the two accounts in it. Unread messages are marked until you open them, the sent box records whether the other person has opened one, and deleting a message removes your copy only.</dd>

      <dt>How does the catalog work?</dt>
      <dd>The catalog lists hats, shirts, t-shirts, pants and accessories created by members. Items are priced in <%= site.currency.earned %>. Buying an item records ownership on your account and adds it to your inventory.</dd>

      <dt>How do I report a user?</dt>
      <dd>There is no report button yet: the report queue is not built, so no profile or message carries a Report Abuse link. Until it exists, a report goes to the team through the <a href="/support">Support</a> page, with the username and, if it concerns a message, what the message said.</dd>

      <dt>How do I contact support?</dt>
      <dd>See the <a href="/support">Support</a> page for how to reach the team about account problems.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
